      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "&ldquo;This collaboration is meaningful in that it validates the potential of next-generation sovereign AI infrastructure by combining global AI infrastructure technology with Korean AI semiconductors,&rdquo; said Jung Jai-hun, president and CEO of SK Telecom. &ldquo;By linkin…",
