        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:07.333Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Through NVLink Fusion, Rebellions will connect its R200 NPUs within a rack through NVIDIA NVLink &trade; scale-up networking.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-rebellions-and-sk-telecom-announce-collaboration-to-advance-sovereign-ai-infrastructure-with-nvidia-nvlink-fusion",
